      "cooked": "<p>Diabolical deals abound in the week’s gothic game. Hades tries his luck against Lifeline- Blood Mage, Dark Watch Harpy and Siren at the Court of Blood.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"x4VAELaHfnOgzG9puF3VGRTs9Z1\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d65fe93d7c7107802bdd07648f41cd73a900db_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 108 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nThat … was close. At the end, Hades just couldn’t help himself and offered Siren Wealth Beyond Measure, which she used to cause a Storm Surge, two Category 5’s, and finally bringing down a pair of Howling Gales to finish Hades off just in time.</p>",
